with another small book:

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:19.040
an easy 100-page read on
Ozempic and other GLP-1 drugs.

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:21.200
Go to NutritionFacts.org
and click on “Books”

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:25.440
to see where you can get an e-book,
audiobook, or paperback of it.

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:28.520
NutritionFacts.org is a nonprofit,
science-based public service,

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:30.200
where you can sign up
for free daily updates

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:34.520
on the latest in nutrition research
via bite-sized videos and articles.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.520
Everything on the
website is free.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.360
There are no ads,

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.300
no corporate sponsorships,
no kickbacks.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.920
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.920
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.160
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:51.160
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

